- Version of the bundled wheel: 0.1.2, built from that revision with the local patch in
  `patches/jev-ultrafast-page-load-timeout.patch` (a page-load-scale `Page.navigate` timeout,
  so a page that takes more than 5 s to load no longer fails `browser_open`)
